========================================================================
THIRD-PARTY NOTICES & ACKNOWLEDGMENTS
========================================================================

This application incorporates, builds upon, or links to the following 
third-party open-source libraries, APIs, and creative assets:

---
ACTIVE RUNTIME LIBRARIES & APIS
---

- chess.js (https://github.com/jhlywa/chess.js) - BSD-2-Clause License
  Powers complete chess rule validation, legal move generation, FEN/PGN 
  parsing, and game state calculation across all training, game review, 
  and multiplayer interfaces.

- Chessboard.js (https://chessboardjs.com/ - Chris Oakman) - MIT License
  Interactive JavaScript chessboard UI component and piece drag-and-drop mechanics.

- Stockfish Chess Engine & stockfish.js (https://stockfishchess.org/ & https://github.com/niklasf/stockfish.js) - GPLv3
  Client-side Web Worker AI chess engine powering single-player Practice vs Computer 
  (Levels 1–20), dynamic tactical puzzle validation, and dynamic engine defense.

- Standard Chess Piece Artwork (Wikimedia Commons / Colin M.L. Burnett "cburnett") - CC BY-SA 3.0
  High-resolution SVG vector chess piece graphics utilized across board themes 
  and pawn promotion dialogs.

- Lichess API & Broadcast Streams (https://lichess.org/) - AGPLv3 / Open API
  Powers real-time Lichess TV live grandmaster broadcasts across 6 channels and 
  daily tactical puzzle feeds via official Lichess open APIs. 
  Lichess is an open-source project and all trademarks belong to their respective owners.

- Google Firebase Web SDK & Cloud Firestore (https://firebase.google.com/) - Apache License 2.0
  Cloud Firestore NoSQL database for real-time multiplayer matchmaking session 
  signaling, game lobby coordination, and client telemetry. 
  Firebase is a trademark of Google LLC.

- PeerJS (https://peerjs.com/) - MIT License
  WebRTC Peer-to-Peer data connection wrapper enabling direct browser-to-browser 
  live multiplayer gameplay without intermediate game server relays.

- jQuery (https://jquery.com/) - MIT License
  DOM manipulation, event delegation, dynamic template component loading, and animations.

- FontAwesome Free (https://fontawesome.com/) - SIL OFL 1.1 / MIT License / CC BY 4.0
  Vector iconography across navigation bars, modal dialogs, status badges, and UI controls.

- Slick Carousel (https://kenwheeler.github.io/slick/) - MIT License
  Responsive carousel slider component powering the homepage banner showcase.

- Open Sans Font (https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Open+Sans - Steve Matteson) - SIL OFL 1.1 / Apache 2.0
  Clean modern typography applied across typography stylesheets.

---
EXTERNAL AFFILIATED SERVICES & COMMUNITY HUBS
---

- ChessBase & Playchess Room (https://play.chessbase.com/) - Proprietary / External Links
  External interactive chess club room and game services. All rights and trademarks 
  belong to ChessBase GmbH. (Note: Legacy ChessBase iframe embeds have been replaced 
  with native MChess Stockfish engine boards).

---
RETIRED & HISTORICAL DEPENDENCIES
---

- Bootstrap Framework (https://getbootstrap.com/)
  Formerly utilized in early UI scaffolding; completely removed and replaced with 
  custom Vanilla CSS3 architecture (CSS Grid, Flexbox, and CSS Custom Properties).

- Legacy Cinnamon Chess Engine & Chess Strategy Online (http://cinnamonchess.altervista.org/)
  Historically utilized in early prototypes; transitioned to native MChess custom boards 
  and Stockfish Web Worker engine architecture.

- Legacy Plugins (MooTools, Pirobox, TotemTicker, Parallax, SelectFx)
  Retired and superseded by modern ES6+ vanilla JavaScript components.
